Data
----
The RAVDESS dataset (Livingstone & Russo, 2018, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) is used only for
local, non-commercial method validation. No audio, video or derived sample from
RAVDESS is redistributed in this repository or in any release artifact; it is
fetched by a download script that users run themselves.

Algorithmic attribution
-----------------------
The VibraImage-based vestibular vibration parameters (E1-E12) and the K-value
norm referenced by this project are based on formulas published in:

  V. A. Minkin, "Vibraimage, Cybernetics and Emotions", Elsys Corp., 2020.

The implementation in vibraimage_engine/ is an independent clean-room
implementation written by the project team from the published formulas; no
upstream source code from the original product is copied, and the original
product's proprietary data or binaries are not redistributed.
